Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:40.25,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:02:58.30,Note,,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Previously on Supernatural
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:05.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:08.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽快把你弟弟带出屋去 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take your brother outside as fast as you can. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:13.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:15.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且已经好几天没回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.81,0:00:19.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是爸爸的笔记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Dad's book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:22.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他希望我们继续他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:24.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猎杀恶鬼 拯救人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:25.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:27.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要找到爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gotta find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:29.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是我最想做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:36.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此刻我即将入睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I lay me down to sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:39.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我祈求上帝保佑我的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l pray the Lord my soul to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿天使整晚守护着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thy angels watch me through the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.45,0:00:44.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我安睡到明日曙光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And keep me safe till morning light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:47.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阿门 - 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:57.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 小捣蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good night, monkey-puss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:00:59.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:01.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈回来了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is Mommy coming home?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:06.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没有 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:10.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她要在医院陪你姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's spending the night at the hospital with your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.73,0:01:12.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:13.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在好好睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You sleep tight, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:10.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定漏下了什么没查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. You probably missed something, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查了律商联讯数据库 当地警局报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, I ran LexisNexis, local police records, newspapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:15.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报纸 找不到任何奇怪的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't find a single red flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:17.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定你找对了坐标吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you sure you got the coordinates right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:20.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 我反复查过了 就是在威斯康星州的费区堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. l double-checked.It's Fitchburg, Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:23.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 要是这坐标不重要的话 父亲不会把它传给我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad wouldn't have sent coordinates if it wasn't important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:26.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我告诉你 结果什么都没有 我彻底查过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm telling you, I looked. All l found was a big, steamy pile of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是父亲要我们来猎杀什么东西的话 我可不知道是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Dad's sending us hunting for something, l don't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他会在那和我们碰头 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Maybe he'll meet us there. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:34.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 因为他很容易就可以被找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because he's been so easy to find up to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:37.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是个自作聪明的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a real smart-ass, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:38.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定费区堡有什么值得我们去猎杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure there's something in Fitchburg worth killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:42.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？你怎么那么肯定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah? What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:45.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我比你大 所以我说的都是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, because I'm the oldest, which means l'm always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:48.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 才不是那样 - 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No, it doesn't. - it totally does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:06.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:07.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面的女侍应说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the waitress thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:10.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当地的美生会在进行一些神秘的活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the local Freemasons are up to something sneaky...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:13.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除此之外 没人有听说发生过任何奇怪的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but other than that, nobody's heard about anything weird going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:15.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 几点了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, you got the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:18.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}4点10分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ten after 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.13,0:04:23.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那场景有什么奇怪吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's wrong with this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:32.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经放学了 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}School's out, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:33.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.85,0:04:38.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人都哪去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:41.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种时候这里应该到处是玩耍的小孩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This place should be crawling with kids right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:04:58.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可真安静啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sure is quiet out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:00.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 太可惜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. lt's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:03.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么会这样？- 孩子们都病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Why's that? - You know, kids getting sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:05.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是太可怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a terrible thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:07.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有多少孩子病了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:10.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有五六个 可是病得很严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just five or six, but serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要住院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hospital serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:14.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多父母都变的很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A lot of parents are getting pretty anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:16.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们觉得是什么传染病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They think it's catching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:32.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 哥们 我才不用这个身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude. Dude, l am not using this lD.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:36.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么？- 因为上面写着"比基尼观察员"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Why not? - Because it says "bikini inspector" on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:37.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别担心 她不会检查那么仔细的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't worry. She won't look that close
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:39.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可能根本不会要求看身份证明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hell, she won't even ask to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只关乎自信的事 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all about confidence, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:46.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 我是疾病控制中心的杰里·卡普兰医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hi. l'm Doctor Jerry Kaplan, Center for Disease Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以看下身份证明吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can l see some lD?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:59.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能告诉我儿科监控室怎么走吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, could you direct me to the pediatrics ward, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:04.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 穿过大厅 左转 再上楼梯就到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, just go down the hall.Turn left. Up the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看吧 告诉你这招有用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See? Told you it'd work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来 在楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Follow me. It's upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你能抽空见我们下海德克尔医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks for seeing us, Dr. Heidecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:06:59.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 我很高兴你们能过来一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, l'm glad you guys are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:01.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正打算要打电话给疾病控制中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was just about to call CDC myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是怎么发现的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How'd you find out, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:05.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个叫G. -P. -的人 我忘记名字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, some G.P. l forget his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:09.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他打电话到了亚特兰大 一定抢在你们之前了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He called Atlanta and must've beat you to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以说到现在这已经有6个病例了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you say you've got six cases so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:14.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 5周之内出现了6例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, yeah. Five weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:17.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起初我以为是什么病菌引起的肺炎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At first, we thought it was garden variety bacterial pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:19.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么值得紧张的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not newsworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:20.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:22.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:24.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们对抗菌素没什么反映\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The kids aren't responding to antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:26.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而白细胞数量在持续降低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their white cell counts keep going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:29.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的免疫系统都没起什么作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their immune systems just aren't doing their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:32.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就好象他们的身体机能都瘫痪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like their bodies are wearing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:35.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰一下 海德克尔医生 你以前有看过这样的病例吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me, Dr. Heidecker? - Ever see anything like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:36.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没这么严重的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never this severe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:39.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种传染的方式 我还是头一次看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The way it spreads, that's a new one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:42.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么意思？- 这病以家庭为单位传染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you mean? - lt works its way through families...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:45.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是只传染儿童 兄弟姐妹一个接着一个病倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but only the children, one sibling after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:49.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能让我们和其中几个孩子谈下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mind if we interview a few of the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都还在昏迷中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're not conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:54.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 全都昏迷了？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- None of them? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能和病人的父母谈会吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can we-? Can we talk to the parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:01.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你觉得能起帮助的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you think it'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:05.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近的一个病例是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, yeah. Who was your most recent admission?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得回去陪我的女儿们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should get back to my girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:11.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们了解 我们很感激你能告诉我们到底发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We understand that, and we really appreciate you talking to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说玛丽是你的大女儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, you say Mary's the oldest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:15.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}13岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:17.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她先开始病倒的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She came down with it first, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 接着… - 贝瑟尼第二个晚上也病倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And then - Bethany, the next night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}24小时之内吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Within 24 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:24.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:28.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我已经把所有的事情都和医生说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, l already went through all this with the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:30.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不介意的话 只剩下几个问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right. Now, just a few more questions, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得她们怎么会得肺炎？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you think they caught pneumonia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:34.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们有着凉或是什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were they out in the cold? Anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们觉得都是因为窗户都打开了 两次都是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No, we think it was an open window. - Both times?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:42.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一次我不太记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first time, l don't I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二次肯定打开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the second time for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:47.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我记得贝瑟尼睡觉前我明明关好了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l closed it before l put Bethany to bed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你觉得是她打开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you think she opened it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是没边框的二楼窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a second-story window, no ledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:53.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别人不可能能打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one else could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:00.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可能并不是什么灵异事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, this might not be anything supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:02.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能只是肺炎而已 可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Might just be pneumonia. - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:05.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可能是什么东西打开的窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or maybe something opened that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:07.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 老弟 可是父亲叫我们到这来一定有他的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.Dad sent us here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:10.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我想我们可能找到原因了 - 有件事我要告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l think we're barking up the right tree. - l'll tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:13.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么？- 刚刚和我们谈过的那个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - That guy we just talked to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:15.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打赌他暂时还不会回家去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'm betting it'll be a while before he goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那有找到什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got anything over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:29.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:47.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 迪恩 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey, Dean? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:51.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:53.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是什么肺炎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:59.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都已经腐坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's rotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:05.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么鬼东西会留下这样的手印？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell leaves a handprint like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:15.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.11,0:10:20.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道规矩的 迪恩 任何人打电话过来都不要接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know the drill, Dean.Anybody calls, you don't pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:23.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是我打的 我只会响一次 然后再打过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it's me, I'll ring once and then call back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:25.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:28.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩 除非是只响一次的电话 不然不要接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't answer the phone unless it rings once first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:30.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 伙计 认真点 这很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, dude. Look alive.This stuff's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:36.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们之前已经做过无数次了 你知道我并不笨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we've gone over it, like, a million times, and you know I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你不笨 可是一点错都不能犯 知道了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you're not, but it only takes one mistake. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:46.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好 要是我周日晚上还没回来的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, if l'm not back Sunday night
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:47.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打电话给吉姆牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call Pastor Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:52.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}锁好门窗 关好窗帘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lock the doors, the windows.Close the shades.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:55.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 最重要的是 - 照看好萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And most important - Watch out for Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:10:59.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我知道 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l know. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:03.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 要是有什么企图闯进屋… - 先开枪 然后再问问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Something tries to bust in? - Shoot first, ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.45,0:11:06.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:25.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道父亲为什么叫我们来这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know why Dad sent us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:32.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他以前碰到过它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's faced this thing before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:37.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想让我们来完结这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants us to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:07.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Shtriga到底是什么玩意？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, what the hell is a Shtriga?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.81,0:12:11.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得是某种象女巫之类的 我并不了解多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's kind of like a witch, I think.They don't know that much about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可从来没听说过 而且也没出现在父亲的日记里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never heard of it, and it's not in Dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.35,0:12:17.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲在威斯康星州的福特道格拉斯曾经猎杀过一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad hunted one in Fort Douglas, Wisconsin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概在16 17年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about 16, 17 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你当时也在 不记得了吗？- 不记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You were there. You don't remember? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:24.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜他有听到风声说在费区堡又出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Guess he caught wind it's in Fitchburg
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:25.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以才给我们这个坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and kicked us the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:27.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这么说来 这个 - Shtriga. -\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- So wait, this... - Shtriga.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:30.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 你认为就是父亲曾经猎杀过的那个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right. You think it's the same one Dad hunted before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:34.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是父亲已经猎杀过了 为什么现在它还没消失？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Dad went after it, why is it still breathing air?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:37.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 因为当时它跑了 - 跑了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Because it got away. - Got away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:39.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 对 萨姆 这种事发生过 - 可不是经常能发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah, Sammy. lt happens. - Not very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:40.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道该怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know what to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:43.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许父亲只是那天失手了而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe Dad didn't have his Wheaties that morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:44.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What else do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:46.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有了 我当时也只是个孩子而已 记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing. l was a kid, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}单人间还是双人间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King or two queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}双人间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:06.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我猜也是 - 你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah, I bet. - What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:08.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车不错. -\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:10.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗨 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:12.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 要入住吗？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Checking in? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:15.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮忙去拿点你弟弟的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do me a favor, go get your brother some dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:16.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在招待客人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm helping a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:23.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}双人间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:28.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有趣的孩子 没错 他也那么觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Funny kid.Oh, yeah. He thinks so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:31.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 付现金还是用信用卡？- 能用万事达信用卡吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Will that be cash or credit? - You take MasterCard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:34.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了 给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perfect. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:54.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸什么时候回来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When's Dad gonna get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:58.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 明天什么时候？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- When? - l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通常来说会很晚回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He usually comes in late, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:01.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 开始吃饭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, eat your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:04.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经吃厌Scabetti牌的麦片了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sick of "scabetti-ohs."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:06.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你自己要吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you're the one who wanted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:08.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想吃Lucky Charms牌的麦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want Lucky Charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:11.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 已经没有Lucky Charms了 - 我看到盒子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- There's no more Lucky Charms. - l saw the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:13.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能还剩点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, maybe there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.51,0:14:17.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是也只够你一个人吃的 我什么都还没吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But there's only enough left for one bowl, and l haven't had any yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:42.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要这个奖品吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you want the prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:49.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:02.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管很难找到 可你说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It wasn't very easy to find, but you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:07.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Shtriga是一种女巫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A Shtriga is a kind of witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:08.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自阿尔巴尼亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're Albanian
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:11.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是有关它们的传说要追溯到古罗马时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but legends about them date back to ancient Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:13.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们以精神能量为食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They need off of spiritus vitae.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 精神是什么？- Vitae\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Spirit what? - Vitae.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.99,0:15:19.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意思是"生命能源"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Latin. Translates to "breath of life."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:22.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}类似生命能量或是精华之类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kind of like your life force or essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:25.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生不是说那些孩子的身体机能都瘫痪了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Didn't the doctor say the kids' bodies were wearing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:27.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是种想法而已 它吸走了你的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a thought. She takes your vitality
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:29.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的免疫功能就丧失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}maybe your immunity goes to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:30.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后才会患上肺炎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pneumonia takes hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:33.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎样 Shtrigas的猎物可以是任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyway, Shtrigas can feed off anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:35.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不过它们更喜欢 - 小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But they prefer-Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:36.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:40.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是因为小孩子有更强的生命能量 听听这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Probably because they have stronger life force. And get this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:44.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Shtrigas对神和人制造出的 任何武器都免疫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Shtrigas are invulnerable to all weapons devised by God and man."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:48.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是那样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. That's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:50.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当它们进食的时候 并不是免疫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's vulnerable when she feeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:51.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你正好抓到它正在进食的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you catch her while eating
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:55.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能用神圣的子弹消灭它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you can blast her with consecrated wrought iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:57.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大号铅弹或者是铁弹之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Buckshots or rounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:02.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你怎么知道这些？- 父亲告诉过我 我还记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How do you know that? - Dad told me. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:05.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:08.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么父亲还有提及别的什么的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So anything else Dad might've mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:11.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 就这些了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:15.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:21.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:24.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们假设在它进食的时候可以消灭它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So assuming we can kill it when it eats
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:25.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还是得先找到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we still gotta find the thing first...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:26.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这并不是什么容易的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which aingt gonna be a cakewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:29.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Shtrigas不猎食的时候伪装成人的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shtrigas take a human disguise when they're not hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:32.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么样的伪装？- 有史可稽 它们会装成无害的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What kind of human disguise? - Historically, something innocuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:35.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以是任何人 不过一般伪装成衰弱的老妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything, but it's usually a feeble old woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:38.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这就是那些老巫婆传说的由来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which may be how the whole witches-as-old-crones legend got started.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:41.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 等等 - 怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hang on. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:45.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这个 我标记了所有受害者的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check this out. I marked down all the addresses of the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:48.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些房子之间相距甚远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These are the houses that have been hit so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:50.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但都围绕着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And dead center...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:54.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们上午在医院的时候 我有看到一位病人 一位老妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we were there, I saw a patient, an old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:56.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 一位老人 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- An old person, huh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:58.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在医院吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:01.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呼 是时候叫海卫队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoo. Better call the coast guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:04.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你这自以为是的家伙 她墙上有个倒十字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen, smart-ass. She had an inverted cross hanging on her wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 晚安 海德克尔医生 - 明天见 贝蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Good night, Doctor HayDecker. - See you, Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:24.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}试着睡会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Try to get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:36.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:37.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:41.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想偷我的东西吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're trying to steal my stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.99,0:18:43.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这附近老有小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're always stealing around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:46.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是的 女士 我们是维修工人 很抱歉吓到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, madam, we're maintenance.We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:48.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们以为你睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We thought you were sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:52.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡扯 我可是睁着只眼睡觉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nonsense. l was sleeping with my peepers open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:58.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以顺便修下那个十字架吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And fix that crucifix, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:19:02.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经叫过四次让人来修了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've asked four damn times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:05.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"我可是睁着只眼睡觉的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I was sleeping with my peepers open"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:07.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我差点就真的开枪了 我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I almost smoked that old gal, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:09.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真该看看你当时的表情 迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, man. You should've seen your face, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.17,0:20:15.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管笑吧 我们又回到起点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yeah. Laugh it up.We're back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.31,0:20:32.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:35.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我弟弟病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My brother's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.81,0:20:37.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个小家伙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:39.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肺炎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.27,0:20:40.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他住院了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:43.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:46.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是你的错 怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, come on. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:49.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该查看下窗户有没关好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should have made sure the window was latched.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:52.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是窗户关好了 他就不会得肺炎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wouldn't have got pneumonia if the window was latched.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:20:59.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:02.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证这一切都不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can promise you that this is not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:06.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照看他是我的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's my job to look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.89,0:21:15.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michael
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:19.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我走了之后挂上"停止营业"的牌子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn on the "no vacancy" sign while l'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:22.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫丹尼斯来负责客房服务了 所以别担心客房的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l've got Denise covering room service.So don't worry about the room
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:23.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:25.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 现在不行迈克尔 - 我得去看看阿舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Not now, Michael. - But l gotta see Asher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.45,0:21:26.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 迈克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:30.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 我知道你现在的感觉 我也是当兄长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey. I know how you feel, okay? I'm a big brother too...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:33.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是你现在不能再让你母亲分心 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but you gotta go easy on your mom right now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.41,0:21:35.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 该死 - 我来拣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Damn it. - l got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:38.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:41.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个样子不能开车 我送你去医院吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're in no condition to drive.Let me give you a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:44.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 我不能那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No, I couldn't possibly-No, it's no trouble. l insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:50.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不麻烦 我送你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:54.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乖点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:04.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一定要消灭它 一定要消灭它 听清楚了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're gonna kill this thing.I want it dead, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.13,0:22:25.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 - 嘿 孩子怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey. - Hey. How's the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:29.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不怎么好 你在哪？我在图书馆里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He's not good. Where you at? - I'm at the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:32.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看能不能找到更多这个Shtriga的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trying to find out as much as l can about this Shtriga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:36.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 找到什么没有？- 坏消息. -\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah, what do you got? - Well, bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.18,0:22:39.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从你说父亲在福特道格拉斯 那时开始着手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I started with-With Fort Douglas, around the time you said Dad was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.81,0:22:41.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 然后呢？- 一样的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And? - Same deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.11,0:22:45.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那之前 还在奥格登市出现过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before that, there was There was Ogdenville.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:50.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外之前还有北溪哈弗和布罗克韦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before that, North Haverbrook and Brockway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:53.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每15到20年 它就袭击一个新的城镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every 15 to 20 years it hits a new town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.49,0:22:57.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 它在菲奇堡只是刚刚开始而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, this thing is just getting started in Fitchburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在其他地方 在它最终消失前 它的猎食要持续几个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In all these other places, it goes on for months...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:02.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要殃及很多孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}dozens of kids before the Shtriga finally moves on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.83,0:23:06.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些孩子只是持续昏厥 然后再死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kids just languish in comas and then they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.46,0:23:09.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最远能追溯到什么时候？我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How far back does this thing go? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:13.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能找到最早提及的是在1890年代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Earliest mention I could find was this place called Black River Falls...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:14.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫做黑色瀑布的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}back in the 1890s.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:17.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简直就是在看一部恐怖秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Talk about a horror show.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:21.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.81,0:23:22.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:26.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等会 我正在看着一张图片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold on. I'm looking at a photograph right now of a bunch of doctors...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.69,0:23:29.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面有一群医生站在一个孩子的床边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}standing around a kid's bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:32.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中有个医生就是海德克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of the doctors is Heidecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:37.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后呢？这张照片是在1893年照的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And? - And this picture was taken in 1893.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:41.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定吗？确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:43.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:04.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.98,0:24:06.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的儿子不会出什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your son's in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:08.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会好好照顾他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.40,0:24:12.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疾病控制中心到现在有什么进展吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, what's the CDC come up with so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.91,0:24:16.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还在研究一些理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're still working on a few theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.89,0:24:17.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一有消息就马上通知你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll know something as soon as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.62,0:24:21.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些孩子对我来说比什么都重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, nothing's more important to me than these kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.41,0:24:24.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么要帮忙的地方尽管提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just let me know if I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.21,0:24:27.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:33.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们之前就应该想到了 医生正是极好的伪装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should have thought of this before.A doctor's a perfect disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:36.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们信任医生 正好可以掌控大局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're trusted.You can control the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:41.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.22,0:24:44.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我纳闷你当时怎么不对他动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm surprised you didn't draw on him right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.44,0:24:46.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩 …\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.61,0:24:50.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 我才不会在儿科监控室开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}first of all, I'm not gonna open fire in a frigging pediatrics ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:53.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好理由 - 第二 根本起不到什么作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Good call. - Second, it wouldn't have done any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.32,0:24:56.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那混蛋对子弹免疫 除非他正在猎食中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bastard's bulletproof unless he's chowing down on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.45,0:24:59.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外 我身上没装备 说起来这样真算便宜了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And third, I wasn't packing, which is probably a really good thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.08,0:25:02.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我就会不顾什么原则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because I probably would've just burned a clip in him
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:03.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上去赏他几个耳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}off the principle alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.96,0:25:07.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 长大了才变聪明 迪恩 - 你说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're getting wise in your old age. - You're damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:09.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我知道我们现在该怎么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because now I know how we're gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.25,0:25:11.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.46,0:25:14.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那个Shtriga它以兄弟姐妹为猎物对吧？- 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- The Shtriga works through siblings? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.42,0:25:16.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那么 昨天晚上… - 它袭击了Asher\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Well, last night-lt went after Asher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.09,0:25:19.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以今天晚上可能会来袭击Michael\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tonight it's gonna come after Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.14,0:25:20.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得马上把他带离这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we gotta get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:23.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 那样只会坏掉整个计划 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No, that would blow the whole deal. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:27.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是啊 - 你想拿那孩子当诱饵？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah. - Then you wanna use the kid as bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.44,0:25:30.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是不是疯了？别想了 这不可能会成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you nuts? No. Forget it.That's out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.91,0:25:32.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不不 萨姆 这是唯一的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No no no sam, It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.49,0:25:34.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是它再消失了 可能要再等很多年才会有下一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If this thing disappears, it could be years before we get a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.11,0:25:37.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克尔只是个孩子而已 我才不会让他面对那鬼玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michael is child, I'm not gonna dangle him in front
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.78,0:25:38.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象钓钩上的鱼饵一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of that thing like a worm on a hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:40.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲叫我到这来 不是叫我什么也不干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad did not send me here to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:43.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不只叫你到这来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send you here? He didn't send you here, he sent us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.45,0:25:44.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是叫我们到这来 这根本不管你的事情 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This isn't about you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.88,0:25:46.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是搞砸事情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm the one that screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:48.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是我的错 都是因为我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's my fault. There's no telling how many kids
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.59,0:25:49.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才会有这么多的孩子 受到伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have gotten hurt because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.13,0:25:52.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么 迪恩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you saying, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.34,0:25:54.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这怎么会是你的错？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is it your fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:01.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.51,0:26:03.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于这Shtriga 你有什么事情瞒着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you've been hiding something from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.97,0:26:06.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从什么时候父亲开始猎杀失败？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since when does Dad bail on a hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.69,0:26:09.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从什么时候他开始让什么鬼怪逃走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since when does he let something get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.69,0:26:12.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, talk to me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.32,0:26:15.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我到底发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.87,0:26:27.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在威斯康星州道格拉斯堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fort Douglas Wisconsin
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.37,0:26:32.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是在那个破烂的房子的第三个晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was the third night in this crap room...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.38,0:26:35.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时出了门 我需要呼吸点新鲜空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I was climbing the walls, man.I needed to get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.04,0:27:07.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.16,0:27:09.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要关门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're closing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.85,0:28:14.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.78,0:28:25.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.12,0:28:28.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy. Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.62,0:28:32.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你没事吧？- 爸爸 怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You okay? - Dad, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.75,0:28:34.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.63,0:28:43.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 发生什么了？- 我刚出去了下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What happened? - l just went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.51,0:28:48.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么？- 我只出去了一会 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - Just for a second. l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:51.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你不许离开房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told you not to leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.31,0:28:53.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你不要让他离开你的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told you not to let him out of your sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:10.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲只是带上我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad just grabbed us and booked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.16,0:29:15.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}花了三个小时把我们放到吉姆牧师那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dropped us off at Pastor Jim's about three hours away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.71,0:29:20.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等他回到道格拉斯堡的时候 那个Shtriga已经消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By the time he got back to Fort Douglas, the Shtriga disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.34,0:29:22.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就那么消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was lt was just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.68,0:29:28.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到现在才又再出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It never resurfaced until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.68,0:29:32.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲从此再也没提起那件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, Dad never spoke about it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:34.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也从没问过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.56,0:29:38.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是他 呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.36,0:29:43.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对待我也不同了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He looked at me different, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.07,0:29:45.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说那是更糟的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which was worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.70,0:29:48.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会责怪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not that l blamed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:52.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他给我下的命令 我没有遵守 而且我差点让你被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He gave me an order, and l didn't listen. I almost got you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.58,0:29:55.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你只是个孩子而已 - 别那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You were just a kid. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.33,0:29:57.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.42,0:30:01.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲知道对我来说这是我要完成的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad knew this was unfinished business for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.09,0:30:04.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫我来消灭它的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sent me here to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.76,0:30:09.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是利用迈克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But using Michael...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.76,0:30:11.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.64,0:30:14.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说 不如我们其中一个藏在被子下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, how about one of us hides under the cover, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.89,0:30:16.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们做诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll be the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.56,0:30:20.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不会有用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.77,0:30:23.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要贴的足够近它才能够进食 它会发现我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's gotta get close enough to feed.It'll see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.94,0:30:28.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 我也不喜欢这样 可是只能让那孩子来当诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Believe me, l don't like it, but it's gotta be the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.16,0:30:38.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定是疯了 快点走开 不然我就要叫警察了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're crazy. Just go away, or l'm calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.92,0:30:40.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先挂一下 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hang on a second. Just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.96,0:30:43.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定要相信我 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have to believe me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.46,0:30:47.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那鬼怪从窗户爬进来 袭击了你的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This thing came through the window, and it attacked your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.76,0:30:49.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.13,0:30:51.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这听起来是什么感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what it looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.01,0:30:54.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为之前它也袭击我弟弟一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because it attacked my brother once too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.27,0:31:05.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个鬼怪 它看起来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This thing, is it, like...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.98,0:31:10.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它穿着长长的黑袍？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has this long, black robe?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.11,0:31:13.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你昨晚也看到了 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You saw it last night, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.62,0:31:16.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为我做了个噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I was having a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.12,0:31:21.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然不情愿告诉你这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd give anything not to tell you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.63,0:31:24.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过有的时候噩梦也能成真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but sometimes nightmares are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.30,0:31:29.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那为什么要告诉我这些？- 因为我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- So why are you telling me? - Because we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.63,0:31:30.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的帮助？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My help?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.01,0:31:34.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以消灭它 我们两个 这正是我们一直在干的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can kill it, me and him, it's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.68,0:31:38.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是没有你的帮忙我们做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we can't do it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.52,0:31:40.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.14,0:31:42.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克尔听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michael, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.44,0:31:45.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那鬼怪袭击了阿舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This thing hurt Asher...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:48.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我们不阻止它 它还会继续袭击其他的孩子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it's gonna keep hurting kids unless we stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:49.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听懂了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.95,0:31:53.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进行得不顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, that went crappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:56.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 现在怎么办？- 你在期许什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Now what? - What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:59.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使叫个成年人来做这种事情也不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't ask an adult to do something like that
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.00,0:32:00.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更别说是小孩子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}much less a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.67,0:32:11.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你们消灭了它 阿舍会好起来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you kill it, will Asher get better?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.18,0:32:19.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老实说 我们也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honestly, we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.56,0:32:25.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说过你也是做哥哥的对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said you're a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.52,0:32:27.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.02,0:32:30.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会一直照顾好你弟弟的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd take care of your little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.11,0:32:33.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会为他做点事情的对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd do anything for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.86,0:32:35.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, l would.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.87,0:32:40.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.75,0:32:43.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.11,0:33:09.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种相机有夜视功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This camera has night vision on it
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.27,0:33:10.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们可以象白天一样看你看得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so we'll be able to see as clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.78,0:33:12.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么样？头发也能看清楚. -\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Are we good? - Hair to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.74,0:33:16.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.86,0:33:18.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要做些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do l do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.41,0:33:22.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要躲在被窝里就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just stay under the covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.45,0:33:24.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是它出现了呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if it shows up?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.75,0:33:29.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就在旁边的房间 我们会带着枪冲进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we'll be right in the next room. We're gonna come in with guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.88,0:33:33.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等我们一冲进来 你就滚下床 藏到床底下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, soon as we do, you roll off this bed and you crawl under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.76,0:33:36.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你们打到我怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if you shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.80,0:33:38.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不会伤到你的 我们枪法很准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We won't shoot you. We're good shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:43.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等你安全之后我们才会开枪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're not gonna fire until you're clear, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.77,0:33:47.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你以前有听过枪声吗？- 就象电影里面的一样吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Have you heard a gunshot before? - Like in the movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.98,0:33:51.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比电影里面的声音要大一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's gonna be a lot louder than in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.15,0:33:53.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我希望你躲在床底下 掩住耳朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So l want you to stay under the bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:58.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们叫你出来之前别出来 懂了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cover your ears, and do not come out until we say so, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.66,0:34:03.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Michael 你确定你要这样做吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michael, you sure you wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.00,0:34:06.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没必要那么做 没事的 我不会生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't have to, it's okay.I won't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.04,0:34:10.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我没事 只要你别向我开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I'm okay. Just don't shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.21,0:34:13.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不会让你发生任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're not gonna let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.71,0:34:15.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.02,0:34:29.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在什么时候了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:33.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}3点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.65,0:34:37.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定这些铁弹会有用吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You sure these iron rounds are gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.24,0:34:42.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神圣的铁弹 上次父亲就是用的这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Consecrated iron rounds.And, yeah, it's what Dad used last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.33,0:34:46.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 迪恩 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Dean, l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.00,0:34:50.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么抱歉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:54.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.00,0:35:00.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直嘲笑你 总是听父亲的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l've really given you a lot of crap for always following Dad's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.51,0:35:06.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 现在我知道你为什么那么做了 - 天啊 杀了我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But l know why you do it. - Oh, God. Kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.23,0:35:13.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.10,0:35:49.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 现在吗？- 还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Now? - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.97,0:36:25.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克尔 低下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey! Michael, down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.94,0:36:37.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迈克你没事吧？- 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mike, you all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.65,0:36:39.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:04.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.66,0:37:36.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.54,0:37:41.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事吧 老弟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You okay, little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.70,0:38:16.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了 迈克尔 你可以出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's okay, Michael.You can come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.41,0:38:52.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 乔安娜 阿舍怎么样了？- 你有看到迈克尔l吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey, Joanna. How's Asher doing? - Have you seen Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.70,0:38:55.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 妈妈 妈妈 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mom! Mom! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.62,0:38:58.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阿舍怎么样了？- 好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How's Ash? Got some good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.91,0:39:01.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你弟弟会没事的 - 真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your brother's gonna be fine. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.21,0:39:05.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的 没人能解释这一切 就象是奇迹一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, really. No one can explain it. It's-It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.51,0:39:09.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们还要让他留院观察一晚 之后他就可以回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're gonna keep him overnight, but after that, he's coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.72,0:39:12.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 太好了 - 其他孩子怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- That's great. - How are all the other kids doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.60,0:39:16.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也很好 很多近几天也可以出院了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good. Real good. A bunch of them should be checking out in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.47,0:39:19.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特拉维斯医生说病房又要变得很安静了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Travis says the ward's gonna be like a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.23,0:39:22.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特拉维斯医生？海德克尔医生呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Travis? What about Dr. Heidecker?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.48,0:39:25.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 他今天不在. - 一定是病了或是被什么耽误了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, he wasn't in today.Must have been sick or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:27.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 一定是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Yeah, must have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.45,0:39:32.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我走之后有发生什么事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So did anything happen while l was gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.28,0:39:33.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 一切如常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, same old stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.03,0:39:36.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好的 你可以去看看阿舍了 - 现在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Okay. You can go see Ash. - Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.49,0:39:38.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你想去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:45.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也得过去了 不然他就要自己发动车子走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I better get going before he hot-wires the car and drives himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.22,0:39:54.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太糟糕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.10,0:39:58.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 他们会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, they'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.39,0:40:00.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not what l meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.98,0:40:04.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指迈克尔 他永远都会记得黑暗里有鬼怪存在的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I meant Michael. He'll always know there are things out there in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.69,0:40:06.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不会和以前一样的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never be the same, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:13.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候我真希望…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes I wish that...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.08,0:40:17.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.99,0:40:20.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望我从不知道这些鬼怪的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish I could have that kind of innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.30,0:40:36.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是对你意味重大的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it means anything, sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.00,0:40:37.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也希望你从不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish you could too.
